Even in 3.0 you could turn into stone when you're not next to her, if you
_looked_ at her when she's awake. It seems the game approaches this looking 
as an _attack_from_Medusa, so it takes Medusa a turn for _you_ to look at her. 
So it goes:

	1st round, you a)pply mirror, Medusa wakes up and walks
					 --no looking occurs!

	2nd round, you a)pply mirror, Medusa dies!

So maybe it _is_ a bug, since apparently in real world you must have seen
Medusa before you apply the mirror the 2nd time.

